@prefix reference: <https://example.org/socratic/reference/> .
@prefix task: <https://example.org/socratic/task/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
reference:ontology a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports task:ontology .
reference:ChoiceState a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf task:TaskState .
reference:ExpectedGainCalculation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf task:Calculation .
reference:points a owl:DatatypeProperty .
reference:publicWinProbability a owl:DatatypeProperty .
